sequenceDiagram
  actor QE as QA Engineer
  participant UI as Browser SPA
  participant API as REST API
  participant ENG as Execution Engine
  participant SUT as System Under Test
  participant LC as Defect Lifecycle
  participant DB as SQLite
  QE->>UI: Click "Run automated suite"
  UI->>API: POST /api/projects/SHOP/runs
  API->>DB: create RUN row (queued)
  API-->>UI: 202 Accepted + run id
  API->>ENG: executeRun (async)
  loop each test case in dependency order
    ENG->>SUT: HTTP request (method, url, headers, body)
    SUT-->>ENG: response (status, body, time)
    ENG->>ENG: evaluate assertions (status, body path, header, text, time)
    alt failed and retries left
      ENG->>SUT: retry (flaky detection)
    end
    ENG->>DB: store result + evidence
    opt result still failed
      ENG->>LC: autoDefectFromResult
      LC->>DB: create / re-observe / reopen defect, auto-assign, notify
    end
  end
  ENG->>DB: mark run completed + totals
  UI->>API: poll GET /api/runs/:id
  API-->>UI: results, defects links
